{"url": "https://wechat2rss.bestblogs.dev/img-proxy/?k=2c8505ee&u=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_png%2FFGB4hYw9Fecl4licO7VDfYrtyicyXxZxhmHRugfm9sibYbzwAjTs49pk7ZlDZAepGNiaibklYI5GI67FdHaicm8LvIyO4rcZHRk5KG8pp7KA69C2w%2F640%3Fwx_fmt%3Dpng%26from%3Dappmsg", "type": "photo"}], "categories": null, "attachments": null, "extra": {}, "language": null, "summary": "ByteDance's Volcano Engine launched SenseFlow, an integrated multimodal AI processing layer built directly into its TOS object storage. It enables in-place content understanding, semantic search, and media processing without data export. Users configure rules to automatically process images, videos, and audio upon upload, eliminating complex self-built pipelines. Key features include one-click templates, storage-compute integration, and custom workflow orchestration. Target applications span intelligent security surveillance, media asset management, and embodied AI training data preparation, reducing deployment from weeks to days."}, "settings": {}}